:''For a full list of stages made for farming XP, see [[:Category:XP Guerrilla Stages]].''
'''XP Stage''' (ゲリラ経験値にゃ！, ''Gerira Keikenchi nya!'', '''Guerrilla XP!''') is an [[Special Events|Event Stage]] that appears on a fixed schedule. However, XP Stage also appears on weekends as a separate map named '''Weekend Stage''' (土日ステージ), with everything else being exactly the same. Weekend Stage was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.3 Update|Version 2.0.3]] and XP Stage was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

The XP Stage/Weekend Stage uses a lot of [[Cat Energy|energy]] per stage, but each stage gives more XP upon completion as they progressively get harder. Additionally, all stages in XP Stage/Weekend Stage can also drop a bonus amount of XP as a treasure reward. Most of the stages here are difficult for very early-game players, so it is recommended to clear [[Empire of Cats]] before attempting Hard and above.

'''Tip''': It is also recommended to use a [[Battle Items#Cat Jobs|Cat Jobs]] and/or the [[Good Jobs! (Combo)|Good Jobs!]] [[Cat Combo]] to exploit these stages' high XP drop.

'''Note''': Unlike most other stages, the amount of XP earned will '''NOT''' decrease as you play the stages many times over. This applies to both XP Stage and Weekend Stage.

