*Monday: 11:00 ~ 12:00 and 22:00 ~ 23:00
*Tuesday: 8:00 ~ 9:00 and 19:00 ~ 20:00
*Wednesday: 13:00 ~ 14:00 and 21:00 ~ 22:00
*Thursday: 12:00 ~ 13:00 and 20:00 ~ 21:00
*Friday: 11:00 ~ 12:00 and 17:00 ~ 18:00
Weekend Stage:
*Saturday: All day
*Sunday: All day
