*Tuesday and Thursday: 11:00 ~ 14:00

==Trivia==
*The Weekend Stage originally only went up to [[Sweet XP (Hard)]]. The old version with three stages still exists, but is unused and has never appeared in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]].
*XP Stage tends to be referred to as "Blitz XP" in the event descriptions of [[Anniversary|anniversaries]] and [[Million Downloads Event|million downloads events]].
*[[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]] reduced the [[Energy]] cost of each stage and also significantly buffed the amount of XP that drops.
*In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], each stage costs half as much [[Cat Energy|energy]].

